      To recycle a gaming console in Kochi, WhatsApp Ewaste Kochi with the console type (PlayStation / Xbox / Nintendo Switch / Wii / other), generation, condition and photos. Working consoles usually qualify for a condition-based buyback quote. Sign out of PlayStation Network / Xbox Live / Nintendo account before pickup. Non-working consoles route to free recycling.
    </p>
